WEBVTT

00:00.800 --> 00:02.200
Report

00:02.760 --> 00:04.120
Three people are coming from the enemy camp

00:04.280 --> 00:05.680
Approaching the city walls

00:08.280 --> 00:08.840
Let's go

00:08.920 --> 00:10.320
Take a look

00:21.120 --> 00:22.520
Who goes there?

00:23.040 --> 00:23.720
Is that on the wall

00:23.800 --> 00:25.200
Prince of Jin?

